  "text": "Home | Veterinary Hospital in Dover | Dover Veterinarian\n96 Durham Road, Dover, NH 03820\n|Call / Text\n(603) 742-6438\ninfo@dovervet.com\nVeterinary Hospital in Dover, NH\nThis Veterinary Hospital in Dover, NH is Your Pet’s Complete Health and Wellness Center.\nDover Veterinary Hospital\nis a full-service Veterinary Hospital in Dover, NH that has been serving pet owners throughout the Seacoast region of New Hampshire and Southern Maine for the past 20 years.\nOur approach to health maintenance is unique, thorough and compassionate. We provide the highest quality preventive, medical, surgical and dental care while also combining the benefits of holistic and other alternative therapies. We offer nutrition and behavior counseling. Through these methods, we are able to maintain and improve the health and wellbeing of your pet.\nPlease take a look through our website to learn more about us, our facility and services.\nGive us a call to set up an appointment for your pet today!\nAbout Dover Veterinary Hospital\nOur hospital is committed to providing not only routine veterinary care, but in providing additional services such as digital radiography, laboratory diagnostics, surgical procedures, dentistry, and holistic approaches to your pet's wellness.\nContact Us\n96 Durham Road\nDover, NH  03820\n(603) 742-6438\nHospital Hours\nMonday & Friday:\n8:00am–5:00pm\nTuesday, Wednesday, Thursday:\n8:00am–5:30pm\nSaturday & Sunday:\nClosed\nVeterinary Website\n©\nVetNetwork, LLC\n-\nContact VetNetwork\nHome\nAbout Us\nAbout\nCommunity Involvement\nLocation and Directions\nHospital Tour\nUpcoming Events\nBlog\nServices\nPet Wellness Services\nDiagnostic Services\nYour Pet's Surgery\nPet Dental Care\nHolistic Therapy\nClient Services\nEmergency Services\nOur Team\nVeterinarians\nOur Staff\nTestimonials\nClient Survey\nResources\nNewsletter\nMedical Articles\nRelated Links\nHospital Forms\nClient Registration Form\nPrescription Refills\nInfographics\nEducational Dog Vide